<title>FRANCE: Lagardere first quarter sales up 14.8pct.</title>
<headline>Lagardere first quarter sales up 14.8pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					13,526    vs   11,777</p>
<p>Breakdown</p>
<p>    -- High technology			   3,927    vs    3,008</p>
<p>    -- Cars and transport			1,496    vs    1,004</p>
<p>    -- Communication/Media		     8,073    vs    7,747</p>
<p>    -- Others					   30    vs	 18</p>
<p>NOTE -- Lagardere Groupe said in a statement that on a like-for-like basis sales were up by 12.4 percent.</p>
</text>
